{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31732","headline":"早起 · 贾岛","name":"早起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北客入西京，北鴈再离北。\n秋寝独前兴，天梭星落织。\n耽翫余恬爽，顾盼轻痾力。\n旅途少颜尽，明镜劝仙食。\n出门路纵横，张家路最直。\n昨夜梦见书，张家厅上壁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}